1
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:42,500
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:47,680
[Episode 3: A 100,000-Yuan Bet]

3
00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:52,570
[Shencheng No. 1 Garment Factory]

4
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:03,840
You know what?

5
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:05,200
The new policies here in the Special Zone

6
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,760
are really kick-starting
the market economy.

7
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:08,760
Many Hong Kong investors

8
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:09,960
are coming here to open factories,

9
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:10,720
make investments,

10
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,720
and trade stocks.

11
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:13,140
Guess what?

12
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:15,120
I've already opened a brokerage account.

13
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,080
You gotta follow the policy

14
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:17,200
to make big money.

15
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:20,760
The winds of the Special Zone
bring opportunities.

16
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:22,960
And for me, the confidence to fight back.

17
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:25,480
Once I sell this design patent
to Chu Chunsheng,

18
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:27,080
I can use that money

19
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:28,960
to leverage even more capital.

20
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,280
One day,

21
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:32,600
I will snatch this factory back

22
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:34,720
from Chang Yongbin.

23
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,330
Right this way, Mr. Chu.

24
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,600
We'll take you to dinner after the tour.

25
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,240
Mr. Chu,

26
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:48,370
the patent sample is ready.

27
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:52,520
What you're messing with isn't a patent!

28
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,400
Get lost.

29
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:55,360
Stop bothering Mr. Chu with this junk.

30
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,289
Director Chang,

31
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,920
thanks for your hard work today.

32
00:01:58,940 --> 00:01:59,640
Not at all, Mr. Chu.

33
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,400
It's my duty, my pleasure.

34
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,280
You've been giving the tour,

35
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:05,800
yet you can't even
explain the fabrics and techniques.

36
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:06,200
Yes...

37
00:02:07,080 --> 00:02:10,210
But you've practically
made my assistant self-taught.

38
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:13,880
Seeing you work through an injury today,

39
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:15,000
it must be tough.

40
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,130
Why don't you head home early and rest.

41
00:02:25,740 --> 00:02:26,620
Xie Nanfeng!

42
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,760
Slacking off during work hours,

43
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:32,079
and using factory machines
for personal stuff!

44
00:02:32,079 --> 00:02:32,980
You're fired!

45
00:02:33,079 --> 00:02:33,800
Fired?

46
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,650
Are you the manager?

47
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,720
What gives you the right?

48
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,920
I speak for the manager!

49
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:42,520
You're just a useless intern.

50
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,450
Pack your bags and get the hell out!

51
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,880
When did I say you speak for me?

52
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:52,079
Manager!

53
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,770
Xie,

54
00:02:55,030 --> 00:02:57,030
thanks to you for introducing Mr. Yang.

55
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,910
[Manager of Shencheng No. 1 Garment Factory;
Yang Yi, Design Director of Xinxing Garment Factory]

56
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,600
Our factory

57
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,080
has finally

58
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:01,600
caught a huge break!

59
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,320
Miss Xie,

60
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,440
may I see this?

61
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:06,040
Of course.

62
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,320
What a pity.

63
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:16,000
Your patent is already spoken for.

64
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,130
That's okay.

65
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:19,600
Once you graduate,

66
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:20,960
I'll hire you

67
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,960
as Design Director.

68
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:24,440
Here at the factory,

69
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,800
you can fully showcase your talent.

70
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:29,200
Manager,

71
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,240
this breaks the rules.

72
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,570
She's just an intern...

73
00:03:32,290 --> 00:03:33,270
Daring to explore,

74
00:03:33,270 --> 00:03:34,230
daring to lead!

75
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:36,079
Have you forgotten
the Special Zone spirit?

76
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:37,600
For a talent like Xie,

77
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:38,280
we absolutely should

78
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,520
bend the rules.

79
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:42,520
Thank you for the offer, Manager,

80
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,600
but

81
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,800
I don't plan on staying here.

82
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,440
Xie...

83
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:50,079
that's a real shame.

84
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,800
No matter what,

85
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,800
our doors will always be open to you.

86
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:15,330
Laugh while you can.

87
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:17,320
When this factory gets restructured,

88
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:19,579
everything you're so proud of right now,

89
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,600
I'll take it all back.

90
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:24,010
I'm surprised you saved the patent

91
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,720
just for me.

92
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,720
Because

93
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:31,450
I only want to do business with you.

94
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:50,050
How do you want to play this?

95
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:53,720
Exclusive rights to my patent,

96
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:54,920
sold straight to you.

97
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:56,820
Your asking price?

98
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,080
110,000.

99
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,120
That price

100
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:03,040
is way above what I expected

101
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,080
for this patent.

102
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:06,600
10,000 is for the patent.

103
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:08,000
The other 100,000

104
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:09,000
is for

105
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:11,400
another deal I want to pitch.

106
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:17,040
A 100,000-yuan deal?

107
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:17,720
Yeah.

108
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,480
It's 4:30 PM.

109
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:25,120
The stock market is closed.

110
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,080
Tomorrow,

111
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,640
I'll take you somewhere.

112
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,300
Here's my dorm number.

113
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:41,770
I'll take you somewhere tomorrow.

114
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,200
Can I take this to mean...

115
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:51,000
Mr. Chu,

116
00:05:51,159 --> 00:05:52,960
pleasure to cooperate with you.

117
00:05:55,159 --> 00:05:56,000
Pleasure.

118
00:05:58,320 --> 00:06:01,000
I'll go grab the patent certificate

119
00:06:01,210 --> 00:06:01,920
and give it to you later.

120
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,600
Then can I assume last time

121
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:05,680
was also part of the deal?

122
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:08,680
Mr. Chu,

123
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,450
you dropped something too.

124
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:17,880
I'm sorry, Mr. Chu.

125
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,280
Last time I...

126
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:20,860
No need to explain.

127
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,880
I can tell the difference

128
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,800
between a manipulative backstabber

129
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,660
and a hard worker who got wronged.

130
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,600
It's just...

131
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:34,080
if you say it wasn't just business,

132
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,680
I'd be very happy.

133
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,580
Let me buy you dinner tonight.

134
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,080
Sure.

135
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,930
But you'll have to wait
at the school gate.

136
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:52,600
Deal.

137
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:02,600
Where is this brat?

138
00:07:03,940 --> 00:07:09,000
[Dormitory]

139
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,400
Where did she go?

140
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:10,680
There you are, you little brat!

141
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,080
You're finally back!

142
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:18,450
What do you want?

143
00:07:18,890 --> 00:07:20,900
[Xie Nanfeng's Father]

144
00:07:19,130 --> 00:07:21,090
You fooled around
with some random guy in the hotel!

145
00:07:21,090 --> 00:07:22,600
[Xie Nanfeng's Mother]

146
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:23,100
Your reputation is in the gutter!

147
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,000
You threw away a perfect internship

148
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,160
just like that!

149
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,080
Are you out of your mind?

150
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,520
Pack your stuff and come with us!

151
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:30,600
You're registering your marriage
with Chang Yongbin tomorrow.

152
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,240
Let's go!

153
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,770
Stop embarrassing us here!

154
00:07:35,270 --> 00:07:35,920
What!

155
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,720
You just want money, don't you?

156
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,920
What exactly did Chang Yongbin give you

157
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:43,290
to make you push me
into the fire like this?

158
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,200
He appreciates you!

159
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,780
He doesn't mind your ruined reputation,

160
00:07:46,780 --> 00:07:47,480
and he's willing to marry you.

161
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,840
That's a blessing!

162
00:07:49,159 --> 00:07:50,840
Don't act all high and mighty here.

163
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:52,640
You sold off my sister back then,

164
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,520
and now you want to sell me

165
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:56,120
to pay for your son's wedding

166
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,400
and house?

167
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,800
Let me tell you,

168
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:02,100
don't even dream about it!

169
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:05,010
Give Chang Yongbin his money back.

170
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,800
You're marrying him
whether you want to or not!

171
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,960
That money is saving your brother's life!

172
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,560
You're coming with us today!

173
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:12,770
How much will it take

174
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:15,280
for you to leave me alone forever?

175
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:17,680
10,000 yuan.

176
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:18,780
Is that enough?

177
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,080
10,000 yuan?

178
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,880
A college student like you?

179
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:26,160
Where would you get that kind of money?

180
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:27,960
You're not bluffing us, are you?

181
00:08:30,490 --> 00:08:31,400
I have it.

182
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,580
But I have a condition.

183
00:08:34,350 --> 00:08:35,549
Sign this paper,

184
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,840
and I'll cut all ties with you
as your daughter.

185
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,799
From now on,

186
00:08:39,070 --> 00:08:40,820
never show your face to me again.

187
00:08:40,820 --> 00:08:42,679
I can give you the money right now.

188
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:00,920
Hold it!

189
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,040
Since you're throwing cash around,

190
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:03,840
you must have more.

191
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:04,760
Give me more!

192
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:05,920
Or you're not leaving.

193
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:06,780
Don't you dare!

194
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,600
You little rebel...

195
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,360
Who are you?

196
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,200
I'm disciplining my daughter!

197
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,460
None of your business!

198
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:15,400
A guy like you

199
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:17,740
doesn't deserve to be her father.

200
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,400
Old man!

201
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,840
Having your blood in my veins

202
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,880
is my only shame.

203
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:28,080
Come look, everyone!

204
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:28,780
An unfilial daughter

205
00:09:28,780 --> 00:09:31,510
is teaming up with an outsider
to beat her own dad!

206
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:34,160
-Let's go.
-They hit us! They're robbing us!

207
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:35,200
Come look!

208
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:36,400
This ungrateful wretch

209
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:39,000
brought some man to beat her parents!

210
00:10:08,150 --> 00:10:08,950
Dad...

211
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:12,840
can you come and pick me up?

212
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,840
Yongbin has such a bright future.

213
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:16,630
Be glad he doesn't find you embarrassing.

214
00:10:16,630 --> 00:10:19,000
What's wrong with you putting up with
a little as his wife?

215
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:21,440
It's not his first time hitting me.

216
00:10:21,560 --> 00:10:23,400
He's going to kill me!

217
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:26,760
Nonsense!

218
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:27,700
Just live a good life with him,

219
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:28,690
and stop embarrassing me.

220
00:10:28,690 --> 00:10:30,290
Who are you on the phone with?

221
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:38,240
Hello?

222
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,000
Yongbin.

223
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:41,680
Dad.

224
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:43,680
Is Nanfeng throwing a tantrum again?

225
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:44,480
It's nothing.

226
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:47,000
Just acting out a bit.

227
00:10:47,280 --> 00:10:47,960
Everything is fine.

228
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:48,690
Don't worry.

229
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:49,720
Okay.

230
00:11:17,870 --> 00:11:19,990
I thought she feared nothing,

231
00:11:20,370 --> 00:11:21,290
but actually,

232
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:23,660
she's just carrying it all on her own.

233
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:26,600
Hiding her pain from everyone.

234
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:30,200
But the more she acts like this,

235
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:32,120
the more it makes people worry.

236
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,360
Thank you,

237
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:39,720
Mr. Chu.

238
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:54,210
Are you alright?

239
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:56,800
Yeah.

240
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:01,800
Didn't I tell you to wait at the gate?

241
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:04,520
But...

242
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:07,090
you weren't coming out.

243
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:10,440
Alright.

244
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,220
Don't forget our deal.

245
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:16,120
I won't.

246
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:17,320
Let's go.

247
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:18,120
Yeah.
